  "type": "page",
  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>ShareSkill</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>ShareSkill App - UI Design</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview: </b>ShareSkill is a community-driven ecosystem designed to democratize education by removing financial barriers. The concept is simple but powerful: a \"Skill Barter\" system. Users exchange their expertise (e.g., Graphic Design) for the skills they want to learn (e.g., Coding), creating a sustainable cycle of mutual growth without currency.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge (Problem): </b>High-quality education is often expensive, and self-learning through videos can feel isolating. The main UX challenge was to design a <b data-path-to-node=\"10,0\" data-index-in-node=\"134\">Trust-Based System</b> where strangers feel comfortable teaching each other. Additionally, the system needed a logical way to match users with compatible \"Supply and Demand\" of skills.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Design &amp; Logic): </b>I designed a platform focused on <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">Social Learning</b> and <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Compatibility</b>:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Matching Algorithm (Concept):</b> I structured the user flow to match users not just by skill category, but by proficiency level (Beginner/Expert) to ensure balanced exchanges.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Trust-Centric Profile:</b> Designed comprehensive user profiles featuring ratings, portfolios, and \"Verified Skill\" badges to build credibility before users connect.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Integrated Collaboration:</b> To keep users within the app, I designed a built-in \"Virtual Classroom\" interface with video and whiteboard capabilities, removing the need to switch to Zoom/Meet.</p></li></ul>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Link</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://bit.ly/3Zq8d5T\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLive Demo\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"27\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4NCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzI3LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/27.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/27.png\" alt=\"27\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"26\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzI2LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/26.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/26.png\" alt=\"26\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"22\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIyLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/22.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/22.png\" alt=\"22\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"23\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIzLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/23.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/23.png\" alt=\"23\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"24\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzI0LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/24.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/24.png\" alt=\"24\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"25\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI4MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzI1LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/25.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/25.png\" alt=\"25\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"d558856\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"21\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTI3NywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMDdcLzIxLnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6ImQ1NTg4NTYifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/21.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/21.png\" alt=\"21\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result: </b>A high-fidelity prototype that promotes a collaborative economy, proving that professional development can be accessible to everyone through community support.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearning \n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCollaboration\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCommunity\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSkill Exchange\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFigma (UI design and prototyping)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUX Research and User Testing\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tTeam Collaboration and Communication\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUser Experience (UX) Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tGraphic Design Principles\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1175\"><p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1175\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1087\">Skill Matching Engine:</strong> Automatically connects users with ideal partners based on offered and desired skills.</p></li><li data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1278\"><p data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1278\"><strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1197\">Profile System:</strong> Each user has a skill portfolio to showcase what they teach and want to learn.</p></li><li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1380\"><p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1308\">Built-in Communication:</strong> Seamless chat and video call integration for real-time collaboration.</p></li><li data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1489\"><p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1489\"><strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1411\">Collaborative Ecosystem:</strong> Encourages peer-to-peer learning, community support, and network expansion.</p></li></ul>"
